Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是奴隶教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}No longer shall you be my Doctore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将成为角斗士训练师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will assume the mantle of lanista…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并可使用你的真名 奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and be warmly greeted by your name Oenemaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,缘何叛乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this madness?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.37,0:00:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯为我等指明道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus shows us the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说在其中一个死人的身上发现了你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sends word to me that one of the fallen bore your name,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就刻在那家伙胸前\N{\fnArial\fs30}carved into his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,执政官一个手势 就可以派你去卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Consuls will present a motion dispatching you to Capua.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.78,0:00:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有宅子和农场 离城市很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are villas and farms, far from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅被转手多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia was handed from dominus to dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们往南走 去找妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move south. To find Naevia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是巴蒂塔斯的妻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Batiatus' wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,模样相似的幽灵罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shadow of the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.53,0:00:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet she lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.37,0:00:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们看到这个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would give the city hope…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.29,0:00:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从斯巴达克斯等人手下生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see a woman survive…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.07,0:00:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能重获希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus and his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.54,0:00:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于失去荣誉的野兽来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is but one place…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个地方可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}for an animal without honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:58.71,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:03.41,Title,0,0,0,0,,《一隅》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可不是小男孩 是可怕的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is no boy, but fucking demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚从炼狱里面生出来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belched from the cunt of the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,您来到地下角斗场 真是莫大的惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your presence in the pits comes as welcome surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰塔斯·巴蒂塔斯大驾光临的消息一传开\N{\fnArial\fs30}When word that Titus Batiatus graced us with his presence…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿发现他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟那批努米底亚人一起从梅洛克手里买来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's with a pack of Numidians purchased from Maalok.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都没活过这周\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others fell within the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.43,0:04:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他脑子不好使 才没跟着他们一起死\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one proves too dim to sniff out their trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受过训练吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he any training?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练 连疯狗都比他招人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Training? A rabid dog would be a more agreeable pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.63,0:04:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他名字都不一定能答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barely answers to the name given him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:05:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论多桀骜不驯的人都能被驯服\N{\fnArial\fs30}All men can be tamed no matter how wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.59,0:05:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要在他心底找到一簇火苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One must only find an ember of purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再吹风浇油\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give it breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.55,0:05:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,火苗有什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give no shit to embers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有钱能让我暖和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coin warms my breast.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要个什么价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the price to see you so inflamed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.12,0:05:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,十个第纳尔 他就归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten denarii and the boy is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要训练 要操\N{\fnArial\fs30}To train, to fuck…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.52,0:05:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you would have of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只出八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.31,0:05:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个 您这么有身份的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight? You appear as honorable man,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.13,0:05:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还挺喜欢玩菊花嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet attempt to slip cock in ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我真有这兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I held such desire,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,非把你操成两半不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would be split in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这么定了 以后要多照顾我生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you this bargain, only to entice further purchases.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 见过新主人 奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise. Greet your new master, Oenomaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filthy animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来在城下的臭水沟里藏身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Living in offal and shit beneath the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是早知道他们藏在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we'd known they were there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在已经带着\N{\fnArial\fs30}we would be riding towards Rome…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的死讯回罗马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with news of Spartacus' death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.47,0:06:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在鬼知道他们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定离开城镇到荒野里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would have left the city to rougher terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话很难彻底搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will be no simple task to sweep such an area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}More men would spur to purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在招募士兵 可收获甚微\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attempts to raise soldiers have born shriveled fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是赛普修斯的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the fault of Seppius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.79,0:06:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是能舞刀弄枪的他都收走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's secured every man familiar with sword as his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.55,0:06:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是时候去找他帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then perhaps it's time we called in call his support.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是瓦里留斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is Varinius' man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.45,0:06:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得我们这么看得起他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not worthy of such invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.89,0:06:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们需要他手下那批人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet his men prove a necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们当初在集市上\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we had them in the marketplace,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.90,0:06:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯根本不可能近你的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus would never have found himself so close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神与你作对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods conspire against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,回你的房间去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to your quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,神明需要虔诚供奉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They demand proper offering…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.76,0:07:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,以血相祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of blood and sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.74,0:07:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说祭神仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of ritual?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,重振巴蒂塔斯家\N{\fnArial\fs30}To restore this house…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们的敌人跪地求饶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to force our enemies to their knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到天明 你就去集市\N{\fnArial\fs30}See yourself to market to gather what you require…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要什么就买什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}when sun greets day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跟赛普修斯见一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall confer with Seppius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll will make arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.61,0:07:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信诸神会听取你的祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe the gods will heed your prayers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.83,0:07:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我祈求正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my cause is just.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.19,0:07:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去求他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then entreat them…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我指明斯巴达克斯逃往何方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to divine where Spartacus has gone to ground…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.56,0:07:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免这个混蛋再取罗马人的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the villain robs another Roman of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略 我要射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiberius, I would finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,插我屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place cock in ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点把我衣服拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My robes! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.97,0:09:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家冷静 不要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike fear and quiet concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.60,0:09:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们与你们无冤无仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our quarrel is not with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.09,0:10:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只与那些以主人自居的人不共戴天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's with those that would place themselves your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人这个词对我们毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}A title that bears no meaning to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.81,0:10:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们愿意 也不必再与人为奴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor to you now, should you wish it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们和我们当初一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are presented choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,面临重大抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要永世臣服于罗马人的暴虐统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}To submit forever to Roman cruelty…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是揭竿而起为自由而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}or to take up arms and to join us in freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么给他们提供选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are you, to present such fucking offer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就凭我是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你们的臭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still your fucking tongues!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是这里的主人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the dominus of this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们应该好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we should have words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:10:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you seek?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.80,0:11:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你说出来 我就满足你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give desire voice and see it satisfied!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该算个人物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a man of fucking influence?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我和行政官关系很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I have the ear of the Magistrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.29,0:11:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以替你传话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can deliver message.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.58,0:11:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只对你听到的话感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is message sent to you, which I have interest in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是巴蒂塔斯的朋友 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were friend's of Batiatus. Were you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.90,0:11:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you not!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一面之缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I knew him only in passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.50,0:11:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有很多痴心妄想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was filled with mad dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如谋得一官半职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of rising in prominence of office.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他需要支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he needed support.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以送出了一件礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}To gain it he sent a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,送到这里的宅子轮流享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}From villa to villa, in this region.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我知道 能饶我一命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I do? My life yet spared?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.49,0:12:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁你还有舌头 快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak while you still have fucking tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.94,0:12:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来过这里 她来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was here! She was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了苟延残喘 你连神仙也敢欺骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would break false word to Jupiter himself, just to see another dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑皮肤 剪得不整齐的短发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark of skin. Um hair roughly shorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩膀后有主人家的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of her domina upon the back of her shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.77,0:12:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.30,0:12:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她后来被拖上马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was put to cart after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来\N{\fnArial\fs30}After?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.41,0:12:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道她如此重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, how could I know that she held meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没有呼吸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she not breathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的心不像别的女人那样跳动吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did her heart not beat like any other woman's?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你根本没把她当女人看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you did not see a woman, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.57,0:12:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你眼里只不过是一个用完不要的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just saw something to be used and discarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.80,0:12:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个卑贱的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just saw a fucking slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.02,0:13:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你的美貌 我勃起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your beauty stirs my cock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.94,0:13:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,勃起了吗 肉眼看不到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rise too slight for eyes to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人身上好臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one smells of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.66,0:13:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从哪儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where does he hail?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gallia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.69,0:13:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪呢 高卢人不懂得取悦女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gauls. They fuck absent regard of pleasing a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.51,0:13:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数男人都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A skill lacking in most men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of Spartacus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的本事怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does he stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.92,0:13:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论哪方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all regard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不知道他是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies. I did not know he was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有这样说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not claim him in such terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.22,0:13:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也没有这种私心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor would he be so enslaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.49,0:13:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提供保护 以换取你的献身\N{\fnArial\fs30}He offers you protection, in return for affections.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有这种想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no such arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是男女之情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it love then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.44,0:14:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 等待爱情的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. The hope of love to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.65,0:14:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是有危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A danger in its own right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要看看食物和补给的数量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need an accounting of all food and supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,找维特斯 督促他做完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Vitus and see it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.19,0:14:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这边没有伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We suffered no casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.80,0:14:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,李斯卡斯和艾克只是皮肉伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liscus and Acer took minor wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.01,0:14:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢人越来越嚣张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Gauls grow careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄到了多少武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many weapons were secured?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来十几个人也能装备起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to see a dozen more men well armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.39,0:14:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们再攻占一家宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will put them to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.33,0:14:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能派上用场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the next villa that we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dominus?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想起了一个奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He recalled a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,身上的标记与妮维雅相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marked the same as Naevia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.98,0:14:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被带到哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was she taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她被拖上马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was put to cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给下一个操蛋的主人享用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be passed to the next fucking dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到她的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find her, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是阻止你们重逢的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see everyone that has kept her from your arms…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.06,0:15:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去教训他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see to my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.47,0:15:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯需要遮羞布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhasko's cock to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.82,0:15:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只有面包屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is given crumbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.59,0:15:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却送他一顿大餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you present his fucking meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.67,0:15:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的心太饥渴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart aches for nourishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要好好滋养才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have it well fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使妮维雅活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if Naevia lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是他记忆中的模样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she will not be the woman he holds to memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要对抗葛雷博和罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we are to stand against Glaber and the Romans,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.75,0:15:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须解放能打善斗的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we must liberate fighting men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.26,0:15:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在无望的目标和无用的家奴身上浪费精力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not waste effort on dwindling hope and worthless house slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有自己的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every man has his worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.17,0:15:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人不久就会明白这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lesson the Romans will soon learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴隶身份的束缚已经不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bonds of slavery have been struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.02,0:16:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们再也不会感受到那紧紧箍住脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never again will you feel them tighten around your neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法呼吸 生不如死的枷锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}robbing you of breath and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.17,0:16:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们自愿加入我们的行列 为正义而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}See your own join your brothers and take up just cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.75,0:16:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人当我们是狗 任凭他们呼来唤去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see the Romans bleed for taking us as dogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要他们付出血的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be yanked by the leash at their command.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.87,0:16:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰科斯 索弗斯 发武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tychos! Sophus! Weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.27,0:16:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁愿意歃血为盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would have blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.35,0:16:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,总感觉黏糊糊的 浑身不自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very air clings to the flesh, tainting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,请闭眼 主人 不要胡思乱想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close eyes, Domina, and replace thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.60,0:17:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Gaius.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你就让人家心神荡漾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give heart cause to flutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是看见水波荡漾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water ripples in evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是肚子里的宝宝闹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The result of your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的肚子里大闹天宫呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And firm kick upon swollen belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么能踢 肯定是男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such aggression prophesies a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会亏待夫君呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would I give you any less?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近付出了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have given much of late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些我都看在眼里记在心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sacrifice has not gone unnoticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我还要你做点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet there is more that I would ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你开口就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need but command it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.32,0:18:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮就陪露迪雅去趟集市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Escort Lucretia to market at dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她坚持要举办祭神仪式 净化这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She intends ceremony to cleanse this house,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,指明我的宿敌所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deliver my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿相信诸神朝罗马撒尿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods would rather piss on Rome…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.69,0:18:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不相信跟她有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}than whisper in her ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里的人相信她的预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}People of this city believe her prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.98,0:18:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能相信她的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is not to be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.46,0:18:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前你还口口声声说她是你的闺蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not long ago you named her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是代价高昂的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mistake dearly paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.79,0:18:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都付出了代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sum costing us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的相信她有诸神庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}You truly believe her blessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们还想重回罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus must fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须剿灭斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we are to be returned to Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那女人嘴里喷出的是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am willing to believe whatever revelations…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要能尽快回到罗马 我都愿意相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}tumble from her lips, if they shall hasten such a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,把身子擦干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}See yourself drieded by loving hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.07,0:19:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后上床吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to our bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于又能睡到真正的床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… to be in a proper bed once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没享受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不知道有这玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never known such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.05,0:19:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就更应该享受了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then it is much deserved…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.03,0:19:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的事情…\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we share…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说有什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}what meaning does it hold for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我怎么回答你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What answer would you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.60,0:20:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要听肺腑之言\N{\fnArial\fs30}One spoken from the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.87,0:20:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经历过太多的痛苦与悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have feasted so long on pain and sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难回想起幸福的滋味\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is difficult to recall sweeter taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了你依偎在我怀里的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except when you are in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们永远不要分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me never be from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经杀过我一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already killed me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次就不要犹豫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not hesitate to revisit the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你无冤无仇 还给了你自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did nothing but offer freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.20,0:20:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么回报他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is how you repay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.20,0:20:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由不用他来给\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was not his to grant!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是主人的贴身奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was body slave to the dominus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有地位有尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had position and respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.27,0:21:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不过是个奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥有的一切全都是转瞬即逝的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you possessed a mere fleeting illusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.32,0:21:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你又取代了主人的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you but take my master's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.56,0:21:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的主人遇到这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what would your master do now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.03,0:21:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,又会怎么处置你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he stood so assaulted?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would see me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.26,0:21:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.41,0:21:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的要训练这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yet wish to train this fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该给这孩子机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy deserves opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为他有了机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was given such a thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以才跑去刺杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made attempt on your life in response.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods save me,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.96,0:21:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然同意高卢人的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find myself in agreement with a Gaul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他满脑子只有奴隶思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has known nothing but slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.98,0:21:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种思想的束缚并不容易解除\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strength of such a tether not easily severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.53,0:21:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许永远解除不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps never to be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.64,0:21:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我们杀了他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if we take his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些自愿加入我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What message will that send to those…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有什么样的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}who wish to join our cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.93,0:21:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明智的话就老实点呗 - 那不成了罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That they had best be agreeable. - We're Romans then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,用恐惧和死亡的威胁统治别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commanding through fear and threat of death?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:21:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他胆敢再袭击人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he makes attempt again,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证让他和他该死的主人团聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make sure he joins his fucking dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你打算怎么训练这条小疯狗呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you propose we train this wild little dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.78,0:22:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟巴蒂塔斯家的教练训练我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Batiatus had Doctore train me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那确实训练得好哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that turned out so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱比瑞斯抽到了霹雳箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liberius draws Plumbatae!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.31,0:23:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多奈克瑟斯抽中了夺魂链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Addonexus selects Vinculum!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.23,0:24:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.30,0:24:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经赢得了比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stand in victory in my match.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.37,0:24:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,而教练却以鞭抽棒打作为回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet Doctore provides only lash and rod as reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.29,0:24:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你应该得到别的奖赏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe you deserve otherwise?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.05,0:24:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是冠军诞生之地 奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a house of champions, Oenomaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.15,0:24:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是它服从你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not submit to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.29,0:24:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你服从它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You submit to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.42,0:24:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,先学会屈膝下跪 以后才能屹立不倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}One must learn to kneel, if he is ever to rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是必修课\N{\fnArial\fs30}A necessary lesson…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.71,0:24:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想加入巴蒂塔斯家族的冠军之列\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you are to one day join the champions of the House of Batiatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.87,0:24:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可能成为冠军呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is such a thing possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就在你的心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer lies within your breast!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.28,0:24:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥有不符合年龄的强大力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight with the strength of men beyond your meager years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.31,0:24:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有经过训练 不能完全发挥出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet lack the discipline to see it properly harnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,昆图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quintus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.03,0:24:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒两杯蜂蜜酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two cups of mulsum.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.85,0:25:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.90,0:25:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最难的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}The most difficult of tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.83,0:25:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须找到自己的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must discover your purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.56,0:25:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}My purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.60,0:25:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}That which you fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.29,0:25:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为生存而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.68,0:25:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}As do we all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.68,0:25:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要想有超人的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to grasp the heavens…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.21,0:25:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就必须找到更伟大的目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must fight for something greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,远比生存重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something beyond mere survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.40,0:25:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是我的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.11,0:25:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,您一声令下 我就去战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight for whatever you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.54,0:25:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.05,0:25:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论奴隶还是自由人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a decision each man,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,都必须独立思考做出决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether slave or free born, must forge himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.84,0:25:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,全在于你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is yours alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你的目标干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.99,0:26:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为你未来的命运干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the destiny it shall lead you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.84,0:27:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿多奈克瑟斯 胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Addonexus! Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.57,0:27:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也太勉强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just fucking barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再叫一个人过来打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send another to face me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.78,0:27:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他的对手该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of his opponent?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.17,0:27:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起叫过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.00,0:27:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last position!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.71,0:27:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.99,0:27:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,左臂别放下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your left arm up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.02,0:27:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.57,0:27:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,盾牌和剑都要灵活使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry a shield as well as sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.22,0:27:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是对准人 而是肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the man, the shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.79,0:27:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.82,0:27:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.90,0:28:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.23,0:28:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你侧面门户大开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expose flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.17,0:28:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多好手都栽在了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ruin of many a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.56,0:28:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm no fucking soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.71,0:28:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.09,0:28:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一式和第二式\N{\fnArial\fs30}First and second position.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.05,0:28:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.32,0:28:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象的重多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heavier than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.41,0:28:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候会变轻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will lighten in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.94,0:28:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到它轻如鸿毛的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it becomes as a feather?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.64,0:28:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得它应该飞向哪里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What purpose do you think it shall fly to?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.46,0:28:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你自己的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of your own choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.44,0:28:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在站好了 - 第二式\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now set foot to path, - And second position!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.11,0:28:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来向我进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.25,0:28:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,早该把这小子干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should have put the boy down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.46,0:29:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬过人的狗 迟早还会露牙齿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dog bites once, he will bare fucking teeth again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.85,0:29:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.89,0:29:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么盯着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do they stare?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.97,0:29:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能不盯\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.59,0:29:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位受到诸神庇护的人来到他们身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}When one blessed by the gods moves among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.67,0:29:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.36,0:29:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.02,0:29:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前都不怎么谈论神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rarely spoke of them, in times past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.71,0:29:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在说起来倒是像模像样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the divine is held as confidant and council.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,今非昔比嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.75,0:29:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious words.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.45,0:29:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个自称失忆的人居然这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}From one who claims no memory of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.96,0:29:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,当曙光来临之时 回忆的影像汇聚成形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shadows of it begin to form, in the light of a new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.16,0:29:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么形状呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shape do they take?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.00,0:29:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩曾经交换过的一个秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of secrets passed between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.27,0:30:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你并不是经常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You confess that you do not always…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.25,0:30:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你父亲的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}heed the commands of your father,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.25,0:30:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你丈夫的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}or your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.48,0:30:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我第一次到你们家的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak of my first visit to your villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.02,0:30:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我们还没有真正了解对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we had yet to come to truly know one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.71,0:30:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时只想讨你开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I so wished to please you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.25,0:30:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是将军的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the wife of the Legatus!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.21,0:30:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天赐良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.25,0:30:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道当我在家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not know what it means,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.57,0:30:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次看到你的时候 我是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to find you within the walls of my house once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.50,0:30:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了活力和希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filling it with life and promise…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.31,0:30:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那种暴行中幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}To survive such barbarity…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.97,0:30:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真是受到诸神庇护的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are truly touched by the gods…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.27,0:30:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.95,0:30:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.03,0:30:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.57,0:31:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.85,0:31:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们似乎被她迷住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They seem rather taken with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.69,0:31:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛皮娅 见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seppia. A welcomed sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.30,0:31:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥刚动身去找你丈夫会谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother only just departed to sit with your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.83,0:31:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人和他们的政治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men and their politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.16,0:31:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别管他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us leave them to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.30,0:31:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈谈更要紧的事情吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn thought toward more pressing subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.63,0:31:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马最近有什么八卦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What news of latest scandal from Rome!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.26,0:31:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,丈夫和即将出生的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Husband and coming child…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.81,0:31:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人有了这两样就不关心八卦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have drawn attention from such events.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.99,0:31:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信 你居然变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot believe you so removed!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.94,0:31:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你几乎和所有人的关系都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are acquainted with positively everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.07,0:31:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,却只有区区几个人想要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet desired by more than a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.54,0:31:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真嫉妒你当年那么红\N{\fnArial\fs30}How I envy such attentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.54,0:31:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很怀念啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how I miss them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.79,0:31:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了丈夫 这么多乐子都没有了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must all joy be so abandoned when weighted with husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.06,0:31:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.74,0:31:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果女人能正常生育的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a woman is of proper breeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.86,0:31:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, how miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.29,0:31:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我该乞求神明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I should entreat the gods…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.59,0:31:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免这种悲惨的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}to shield me from such dour fate…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.67,0:31:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.60,0:32:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.16,0:32:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the gods bless you…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.55,0:32:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Gods bless you…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.57,0:32:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Gods bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.13,0:32:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿诸神保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Gods bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.01,0:32:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯曾在你麾下 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus was one of yours, was he not?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.03,0:32:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,色雷斯那场极其短暂的战事\N{\fnArial\fs30}During your overly brief campaign in Thrace?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.76,0:32:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,召来的炮灰而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conscripted to the auxiliary.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.16,0:32:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那畜生当时就不太听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}An animal prone to disobedience even then.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.87,0:32:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那畜生是你带到这儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beast you brought to our shores.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.50,0:32:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想让他死在竞技场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}To die in the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.60,0:32:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet he lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.29,0:33:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的恶趣味害死了我尊贵的堂兄赛克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pleasure denied my noble cousin Sextus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.24,0:33:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都蒙受不幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many have suffered injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.67,0:33:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的死讯必是一剂良药\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be healed by news of Spartacus' fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.75,0:33:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数月以来殚精竭虑正是为了此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A venture I eagerly set hands to months past.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.20,0:33:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在元老院听说了你的努力 非常感人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes word touched me in the Senate of your efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.05,0:33:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有多少手下一去不回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of your men has he sent to the afterlife?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.34,0:33:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙相当狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man proves resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.37,0:33:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他胆敢在集市上攻击你就是明证\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he did when he set upon you in the market square.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.89,0:33:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾我的人没有出面解决这一麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a pity my men were not present to end the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.37,0:33:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾说过 斯巴达克斯是公敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus stands a common foe, as I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.76,0:33:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我的护民官抓住了重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my tribune cleaves to the heart of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.83,0:33:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯是我们共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is enemy to us both,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.58,0:33:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有血债要他偿还\N{\fnArial\fs30}shared in offense and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.28,0:33:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们还是抛开分歧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let us sweep aside differences,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.76,0:33:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,精诚合作 务必要他下跪投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in union see him forced to knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.18,0:34:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要跟瓦里留斯商量你的提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would need to consult Varinius towards such agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.48,0:34:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手下听你的还是听他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they your men, or his?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.31,0:34:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,联手之后由谁主事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who would lead combined effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.15,0:34:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有剿匪的名分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shall hold station of note,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.86,0:34:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要听我的指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}second only to my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.79,0:34:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,并保证斯巴达克斯伏法之日\N{\fnArial\fs30}And promise that you shall be present…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.44,0:34:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要到场\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Spartacus is put to grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.39,0:34:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙从你眼皮底下溜走多少次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man takes habit of slipping through your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.18,0:34:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟哪儿来的信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}What moves you to certainty of victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.40,0:34:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是诸神的意愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the gods themselves will it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.48,0:34:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正跟你说话 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They speak with you now do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.79,0:34:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,借这家宅院的旧主人之口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through voice of former domina of this very house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.31,0:34:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.24,0:34:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神保佑她\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have blessed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.40,0:34:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在大屠杀那晚有了诸神的指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they blessed her the night they guided her…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能侥幸活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}from death in the massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.71,0:34:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她并非仅有的幸运儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet she is not alone in such fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.27,0:34:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道不是诸神指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the gods not guide…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.54,0:34:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子才能平安无事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}your wife to safety as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.60,0:34:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅在那之前就离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia took leave before unfortunate turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.31,0:35:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,随行的还有你的一帮手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with her a clutch of your men.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.21,0:35:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些士兵本来可以扭转乾坤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers that might have tipped the balance…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.32,0:35:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止斯巴达克斯的恐怖大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards halting Spartacus short of fucking slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.82,0:35:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在我面前讲话最好客气点 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will tend your words with more care in my presence, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.30,0:35:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 大家坐下来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, let us take seat…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.66,0:35:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经很注意措辞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My words are carefully chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.64,0:35:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对一个只能靠岳父上位的软蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a man holding title as favor to his wife's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.04,0:35:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是胆敢再这样说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak to me in such manner again…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.76,0:35:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的舌头我要定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will have your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.31,0:35:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,可要不走我的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet not my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.06,0:35:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,老屌怒胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cock rages on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.45,0:35:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,老屌怒胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cock rages on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.12,0:35:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,干倒你爹 日翻你娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put you down, I give you shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事撒尿在你坟头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I piss on your grave for the sport of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.81,0:35:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,老子好爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Expect no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.62,0:35:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老屌怒胀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cock rages on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.18,0:36:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.21,0:36:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,奴隶 给我打满酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slave, see my jug filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.19,0:36:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhaskos.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.79,0:36:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,自个儿去拿酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch drink yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.62,0:36:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,打酒回来前可别偷喝 奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not fucking drink jug before return, slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.81,0:36:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太给他们面子了 他们还没那个资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}You offer privilege before it is properly earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.63,0:36:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你想要他们卑躬屈膝 低声下气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you would have them bow and scrape in service,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.57,0:36:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像以前伺候主子那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they did before their dominus?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.75,0:36:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 但我绝不会平等对待他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Yet neither would I have them seen as equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.92,0:36:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不像我们 还不是真正的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were not forged at the brotherhood, as we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.52,0:36:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是自愿加进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They join our cause of their own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.05,0:36:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的火燃烧起来更加猛烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such fire may yet prove more fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.82,0:36:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是在狂风暴雨中熄灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or be extinguished by threatening storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.04,0:36:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮我就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would move at first light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.20,0:36:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多宅子要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are yet more villas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.27,0:37:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到宝贝啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You press fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.62,0:37:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,死死地盯着我们的屠影英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaring so at the slayer of Theokoles.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.16,0:37:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的胜利只是证明了强者也会败\N{\fnArial\fs30}His victory but proving even giants fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.98,0:37:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字 小个子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What name do you go by, little man?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.55,0:37:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好在你死的时候哀悼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I may properly mourn your passing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.42,0:37:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am called Tiberius.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.39,0:37:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiberius!?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.59,0:37:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么黑 怎么有个罗马名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are far too dark to have such a fair Roman name.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.93,0:37:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的罗马血统多过叙利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am more Roman than Syrian.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.64,0:37:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们训练场也曾有个叙利亚人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a Syrian at our ludus.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.74,0:37:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那混蛋相当奸诈 不知他是死是活\N{\fnArial\fs30}A treacherous fuck, if ever there breathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.78,0:37:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那里还有家人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had family there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.95,0:37:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只记得有个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only recall a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.54,0:37:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有过兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I too had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.45,0:37:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.26,0:37:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被罗马人杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was struck down by the Romans.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.69,0:38:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你们起兵反叛的时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you turned swords against them?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.06,0:38:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天你也会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you shall one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.09,0:38:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你还有一点点理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hold any fucking sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.53,0:38:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.75,0:38:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我射的时候要看着漂亮的脸蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see that pretty face as I burst…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.61,0:38:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这该死的畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.60,0:38:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,米拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mira…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.54,0:38:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.53,0:38:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我阉了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or part with your cock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.56,0:38:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不是斯巴达克斯的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were not Spartacus' bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.12,0:38:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就教教你怎么用这把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would show you how to use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.71,0:38:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我的老屌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my cock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.48,0:38:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.50,0:38:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会看好莱斯克斯 - 我是自愿找上他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will see that Rhaskos - I chose to lay with a fucking Gaul.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.94,0:38:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.70,0:38:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是谁都能有斯巴达克斯暖床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us have Spartacus to warm our beds,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.73,0:38:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿正眼瞧我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see us to position.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.56,0:39:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有了自由 还甘愿受这人渣奴役\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gain freedom only to be enslaved by that shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.36,0:39:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,自由不是白来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freedom is not without cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿仅有的本钱去换\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pay with the only coin I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.19,0:39:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.19,0:39:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们该站远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps we should stand further away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.56,0:39:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免诸神的雷电打偏了地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}For fear of errant bolt from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.05,0:39:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这仪式说不定有收获 反正不花钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such ritual may bring profit, absent cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.30,0:39:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那头羊可价值不菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The goat came at no small expense.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.66,0:39:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神向我诉说欺骗与背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods whisper of deceit and treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.38,0:40:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并保证无论何人对你有所欺瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And give assurance that those who would harbor secrets against you…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.67,0:40:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,必将公之于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall be brought to light.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.74,0:40:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,请接受我们的祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accept our offering,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.27,0:40:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙您恩赐 剿杀残敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bless us with your favor against our enemies…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.38,0:40:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么做明智吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it wise?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.22,0:40:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这个疯女人拿着刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To allow such unsteady hands to play with knives?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.29,0:40:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.29,0:41:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心愿已了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will now ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.95,0:41:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不再来一头羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps another goat…?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.72,0:41:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪式结束后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When ritual is ended,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.79,0:41:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,清干净血污 照看好露迪雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}see blood cleansed and Lucretia attended.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.66,0:41:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接下来要对战卡拉塔克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are to fight Caratacus next.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.13,0:41:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一头杀人无数的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beast that has claimed many lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.22,0:41:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为他能杀掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe he shall end mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:41:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你这身体状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.33,0:42:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he does not…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.62,0:42:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,派有本事的人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}send one that will.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.80,0:42:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经迈出了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have taken important step…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.82,0:42:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱离低劣野兽的重要一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards rising above base animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那种地方战斗 我感到羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shames me I fought in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.54,0:42:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无荣誉可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent thoughts of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.95,0:42:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pits are for men…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.96,0:42:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能受辱等死的人才会去地下角斗场\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose lives promise nothing greater than an ugly end.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.83,0:42:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你注定要追寻更崇高的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are destined for far grander fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.26,0:42:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞技场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.00,0:42:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,传奇辈出之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A place where legends are forged.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.14,0:42:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真替那些敢在沙场挑战你的人感到战栗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fear for those that dare take the sands against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.79,0:42:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定让他们死得其所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall make their deaths memorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.92,0:42:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神会很高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.13,0:42:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不为诸神而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not fight for the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.74,0:43:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你而战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fight for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.40,0:43:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的目标 我的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is my purpose. My life.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.71,0:43:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为巴蒂塔斯家族争光\N{\fnArial\fs30}To honor the House of Batiatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.44,0:43:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The honor is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.55,0:43:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.24,0:45:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.60,0:45:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Domina!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.69,0:45:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人拜访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men approach!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.52,0:45:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有火把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torches!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.19,0:45:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从北边过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arriving from the north!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.39,0:45:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.06,0:45:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,六个 也许更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six. Maybe more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.40,0:45:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合所有男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather the men…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.96,0:45:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他们可能是大部队的斥候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. These may be scouts from a larger force.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.71,0:45:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有一人逃出我们的掌心\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a single rider was to escape our grasp,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.82,0:46:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,必将后患无穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}he could bring a far greater concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.40,0:46:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就不给他们逃的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we shall grip tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.97,0:46:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个更好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a better way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.17,0:46:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让罗马人察觉不到我们的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that will keep our movements yet hidden from the Romans…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.75,0:46:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奉赛普修斯的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have words with your dominus,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.17,0:46:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和你的主人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}on orders of Seppius.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.12,0:46:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.25,0:46:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去派肯蒂亚谈生意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Business has called him to Picentia.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.05,0:46:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,派肯蒂亚 没听说过他喜欢那地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Picentia? I have never known him to favor the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.93,0:46:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.06,0:46:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他喜欢的是城里的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}He favors its whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.88,0:46:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的贴身奴隶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are his body slave, are you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.49,0:46:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiberius.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.36,0:46:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiberius.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.69,0:46:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 为什么没和主人同去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, why are you not at your dominus' side?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.81,0:46:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他信不过别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there's no one he trusts more,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.30,0:47:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他享受床笫之欢时 帮他照看宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see his villa attended while his cock is satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.96,0:47:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你倒是尽忠尽职\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serve your master well.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.72,0:47:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,回你的岗位去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to your charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.34,0:47:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,且慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.67,0:47:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们自卡普亚远道而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have come a fair distance from Capua.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.19,0:47:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 我给你们点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, and I will give you something…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.34,0:47:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证不虚此行\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make effort worthwhile…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.65,0:47:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他背叛我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He betrays us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.10,0:48:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.92,0:48:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不让他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you stop them from leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.54,0:48:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed the man…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.48,0:49:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是看到了那些人毫无胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he saw they would not win.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.17,0:49:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他注意到了我的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}His eyes fell to my neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.42,0:49:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看到我的项圈没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw the absence of my collar!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.28,0:49:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我就这么让他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had not allowed him in,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.33,0:49:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会带更多人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would have returned with more men!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.56,0:49:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的很好 提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did well, Tiberius.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.75,0:49:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.28,0:49:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我兄弟管我叫纳西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother called me Nasir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.88,0:49:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁深更半夜前来打扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who disturbs peace at such an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.91,0:49:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是带着礼物来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I come bearing a gift…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.86,0:49:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这礼物能助你铲除斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}which shall set you upon path to the fall of Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.17,0:49:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神果真听到我的祈祷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods truly heed my prayers.
